This product includes a translated and adapted portion of OpenAI Codex's local ApplyPatch implementation.

Copyright 2025 OpenAI

Upstream source: https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch

Translated and adapted sources include:
- https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/src/parser.rs
- https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/src/streaming_parser.rs
- https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/src/seek_sequence.rs
- https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/src/file_update.rs
- https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/src/text_file.rs
- https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/9e868bd9dc007c05e84a98e0b1f4e31dc98c5e6a/codex-rs/apply-patch/tests

Modifications in this port include translation from Rust to TypeScript, integration with Pi's `pi.applyPatch({ patch })` API, and integration with Code Mode's mandatory filesystem sandbox. The upstream Apache License 2.0 text is provided in `apply-patch.LICENSE`.
